cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "credit-risk-explain: explainable, calibrated default-risk ranking for a credit work queue"
abstract: >-
  Ranks a capacity-limited credit work queue by calibrated default risk, attaches grouped
  reason codes to every account, sizes the queue from a cost/benefit matrix, audits the ranking
  across protected groups and generates a model card from the same run.
authors:
  - family-names: McRae
    given-names: Sean
